## Architecture

### Design Pattern: SysOperation Framework

```
Controller (AVAGenBatchLocDirController)
    ↓
Service (AVAGenBatchLocDirService)
    ↓
Contract (AVAGenBatchLocDirContract)
    ↓
UI Builder (AVAGenBatchLocDirUIBuilder)
```

### Query Cloning: Pack/Unpack Pattern

```xpp
// Step 1: Clone query BEFORE setting batch flag
container queryCon = sourceAction.QueryCriteria;
Query clonedQuery = new Query();
clonedQuery.unpack(queryCon);

// Step 2: Create new action with batch flag
newAction.isBatchEnabled = NoYes::Yes;
newAction.insert(); // This triggers query reset

// Step 3: Re-apply cloned query
queryCon = clonedQuery.pack();
newAction.QueryCriteria = queryCon;
newAction.update();
```

### Extension-Based Approach

No modifications to standard objects:
- ✅ Table extension (WHSLocDirAction)
- ✅ Form extension (WHSLocDirTable)
- ✅ Event handlers (no overlayering)

