## FAQ

**Q: Can I run the mass function multiple times?**
A: Yes! It's idempotent - it will skip already-processed records.

**Q: What happens to the original action?**
A: It remains unchanged except for the "Copied" flag being set to Yes.

**Q: Can I copy an already batch-enabled action?**
A: No, the button is disabled for batch-enabled actions.

**Q: Are all query types supported?**
A: Yes, all standard D365FO query features are preserved.

**Q: What about custom X++ code in queries?**
A: Static queries are preserved. Dynamic query modifications in code are not.

**Q: Can I customize the copied action after creation?**
A: Yes, the new action is a fully independent record.

**Q: Does this work with all location directive strategies?**
A: Yes, it works with all standard strategies.

